Value SLOT (\d+)
Value FAN_ID (\d+)
Value STATUS (\S+)
Value SPEED (\S+)
Value RATE (\S+)
Value MODE (\S+)
Value DIRECTION (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Slot\s+${SLOT}:\s+Fan\s+${FAN_ID}\s+is\s+${STATUS}\.\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${SLOT}\s+${FAN_ID}\s+${STATUS}\s+${SPEED}\s+${RATE}\s+${MODE}\s+${DIRECTION} -> Record
  # Skip headers and separator lines
  ^Slot\s+#\s+FAN\s+#\s+Status
  ^\s*Slot\s+FanID\s+Status\s+Speed.*$$
  ^-+
  ^\s*<[A-Za-z0-9_\-\.]+>.*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error
